The derived data tables in data/ summarise annotations from the DCML Distant
Listening Corpus (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), When in Rome (CC BY-SA 4.0), the Rock
Corpus, the McGill Billboard dataset and the Weimar Jazz Database (via ChoCo);
they are redistributed under the terms of those sources.
